; Generated by hledger-flow init as a starter. This file is yours to edit. hledger-flow leaves it as you save it.
; This file is optional. If absent, hledger-flow omits it from the include files it maintains.
; Record manual entries for the whole ledger here.
; The yearly include reads it before the owners’ journals and the year’s prices.
; Docs: https://hledger-flow.github.io/go/manual-journals/

; Example. Remove its leading semicolons and adapt it.
; 2026-01-01 Fund the household cash box from my cash
;     assets:household:cash  150.00 TESTCUR
;     assets:me:cash
